OL,3,GNEWSAMan found dead after 'explosion'
OL,4,Ain Rotherham
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found dead after
OL,7,Femergency services were called to
OL,8,Freports of an "explosion" in South
OL,9,FYorkshire.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to Clifton Mount
OL,12,Fin Rotherham on Tuesday afternoon,
OL,13,FSouth Yorkshire Police said, with a man
OL,14,F"sadly found deceased".
OL,16,FThe cause of the explosion is under
OL,17,Finvestigation, the force said, with gas
OL,18,Fdistributor Cadent Gas confirming it
OL,19,Fwas "not an issue related to our gas
OL,20,Fnetwork".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
